  "design": {
    "idea": "Ripen a seedlight fruit, pluck its glowing seed orb onto the northbound leafcutter ant highway, hang your 1.8x sun-lantern in shade behind the east root wall, and walk dark past the thorn-wall as the ants deliver light to bloom your exit bridge.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ki",
    "teaches": "Using carry_orb seed couriers on ant conveyor highways to deliver light remotely while Wick travels in shadow past light-triggered thorn walls.",
    "decisions": 5,
